message: "If you use this research code, please cite it and the original ZOD paper/dataset."
title: "ZOD Self-Driving Lab: Deep learning with the Zenseact Open Dataset"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-04
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: "Jenei"
    given-names: "Christian"
abstract: >-
  A leakage-audited ZOD study of multiple-shooting NeuralODE and temporal FNO
  ego-trajectory prediction, plus road and thin-lane segmentation
  with U-Net and Fourier U-Net controls.
keywords:
  - autonomous-driving research
  - trajectory prediction
  - neural ordinary differential equations
  - Fourier neural operator
  - affordance segmentation
  - U-Net
  - Zenseact Open Dataset
references:
  - type: article
    title: "Zenseact Open Dataset: A Large-Scale and Diverse Multimodal Dataset for Autonomous Driving"
